The '''Shaltin Tunnels''' were a [[hyperspace route]] that ran through the [[Outer Rim Territories]]. From the [[Lianna system]]<ref name="TFABG note"  /> in the [[Tion Cluster]],<ref name="TFABG">[[Star Wars: The Force Awakens Beginner Game|''Star Wars: The Force Awakens'' Beginner Game]]</ref> the Shaltin Tunnels crossed near the [[planet]] [[Florrum]] in the [[Sertar sector]]<ref name="Revival">{{TCW|Revival (episode)}}</ref> to the [[Zygerria system|Zygerria system]]<ref name="TFABG" /> in the [[Chorlian sector]].<ref name="BMF 91">{{BuildFalconCite|91|Guide to the Galaxy}}</ref>

